/**
 * The system tray icon, embedded rather than read from disk.
 *
 * Two reasons to be here instead of as a file. First: packaging. The
 * `out/` from electron-vite carries only JavaScript, and a PNG alongside would
 * need a copy step that exists only for this. Second: an icon that fails to
 * load gives an invisible tray-the app keeps running, the user has no way to
 * see it, and the symptom is indistinguishable from a failed startup. Embedded,
 * either it compiles or it does not.
 *
 * Two colors because the tray has none by itself. On macOS the convention is a
 * template image: shape and transparency only, and the system colors it by theme.
 * Off macOS there is no template, and the tray is usually dark: hence the light
 * variant.
 *
 * Generated by `marca/gerar-marca.py` (the O redrawn, 16 and 32 px, RGBA).
 */

/** Black: macOS template. The system inverts it on dark theme by itself. */
